    {
      "source": "By default this simply delegates to <a href=\"#resolveArgumentValue(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.messaging.Message)\"><code>resolveArgumentValue(MethodParameter, Message)</code></a> for\nsynchronous resolution.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，这仅会委托给<a href=\"#resolveArgumentValue(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.messaging.Message)\"><code>resolveArgumentValue(MethodParameter, Message)</code></a>以进行同步解析。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve the value for the method parameter synchronously.",
      "translation": "同步解析方法参数的值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>message</code> - the currently processed message",
      "translation": "<code>message</code> - 当前正在处理的消息",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "An extension of <a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation.reactive\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> for implementations\nthat are synchronous in nature and do not block to resolve values.",
      "translation": "用于实现同步且不会阻塞以解析值的 `<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation.reactive\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>` 的扩展。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves a method parameter into an argument value from a given message.",
      "translation": "将方法参数解析为来自给定消息的参数值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.messaging.Message)\">resolveArgument</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation.reactive\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code>",
      "translation": "`HandlerMethodArgumentResolver` 接口中的 `<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.messaging.Message)\">resolveArgument</a>`",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>parameter</code> - the method parameter to resolve.\nThis parameter must have previously been passed to\n<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)</code></a>\nwhich must have returned <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>parameter</code> - 要解析的方法参数。此参数必须先前已传递给<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)</code></a>，且该调用必须返回 <code>true</code>。",
